<title>LATVIA: ROTA H1 LOSS 41,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>ROTA H1 LOSS 41,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rota printing house had a first-half net loss of 41,000 lats on net turnover of 247,070 lats, the stock exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>The company made a gross profit of 59,776 lats, its administrative costs were 35,747 lats and it had extraordinary costs of 56,487 lats.</p>
<p>Its profit before tax and extraordinary items was 17,834 lats.</p>
<p>The company's assets came to 983,016 lats, with long-term debts of 345,325 lats and short-term debts of 260,016 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
